# SCOPE
#   IN-CONTRACT LOGIC (reproduce exactly): the entire predicate above — the three-clause disjunction,
#     the isObjectLike truthy+typeof gate, and the exact '[object Boolean]' tag comparison. The string
#     constant boolTag = '[object Boolean]' is the only literal and is reproduced inline (tiny, not
#     carried data).
#   CARRIED DATA: none (no large literal table).
#   OUT-OF-CONTRACT: none (no stateful mutators, no side APIs, no ambient reads). The single
#     out-of-ENVELOPE input is a live `function` value (codec cannot persist it); its behavior (-> false
#     via the typeof!=='object' guard) is fully specified above for the blind re-emitter but is excluded
#     from genInputs to avoid poisoning the held-out store.
